  "worked_solution": "The product of square roots of two positive numbers is equal to the square root of the product of the numbers. Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{3}\\cdot \\sqrt{5}=\\sqrt{3\\cdot 5}=\\sqrt{15}\n$$",
